<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     TIME DIFFERENCE SECTION & SIDE-BY-SIDE GRAPHIC
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="method-section" id="time-difference" aria-labelledby="time-diff-heading">
  <div class="method-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Time Difference Mechanics</p>
    <h2 id="time-diff-heading">Analyzing the Time Gap: GMT vs NZST</h2>
    <p>
      The time difference between Greenwich Mean Time (GMT) and New Zealand Standard Time (NZST) is exactly <strong>12 hours</strong>. Since GMT operates at UTC+0 and NZST operates at UTC+12, New Zealand runs twelve hours ahead of the meridian baseline. When it is 8:00 AM in London during winter, local clocks in Auckland and Wellington show 8:00 PM local time.
    </p>
    <p>
      This time difference shifts when daylight saving rules apply. The United Kingdom and New Zealand observe daylight saving time on opposite cycles because they are located in different hemispheres. When the UK switches to British Summer Time (BST, UTC+1), the gap between London and New Zealand narrows to 11 hours. Conversely, when New Zealand shifts to New Zealand Daylight Time (NZDT, UTC+13) in summer, clocks in Auckland run 13 hours ahead of GMT.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Custom GMT vs NZST Comparison Infographic (SVG) -->
  <div style="margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 700px; padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px;">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 600 200" width="100%" height="auto" style="display: block;">
      <rect width="600" height="200" fill="#0c354a" rx="8" />
      
      <!-- Side by Side Visual Clocks -->
      <g transform="translate(100, 100)">
        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="60" fill="#12455d" stroke="#2f6278" stroke-width="4" />
        <!-- 10:00 GMT -->
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="-30" y2="-30" stroke="#f4fbff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-45" stroke="#bdd2dc" stroke-width="2" />
        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="5" fill="#36c7b5" />
        <text x="0" y="85" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="16" fill="#bdd2dc" text-anchor="middle">GMT Time (UTC+0)</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(300, 100)">
        <text x="0" y="10" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="32" fill="#36c7b5" text-anchor="middle">→</text>
        <rect x="-45" y="-35" width="90" height="26" rx="13" fill="#1b536e" />
        <text x="0" y="-17" font-family="'Manrope', sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="800" fill="#36c7b5" text-anchor="middle">+12 HOURS</text>
